OL,3,GNEWSABBC boss urges Senedd to press
OL,4,AWestminster over future of funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior BBC bosses want Welsh Parliament
OL,7,Fmembers to press the UK government for
OL,8,Fa funding model that secures the
OL,9,Forganisation's future.
OL,11,FLater this year, the UK government will
OL,12,Fpublish details of the next BBC Royal
OL,13,FCharter - which will set out how the
OL,14,Fbroadcaster is funded, regulated and
OL,15,Fgoverned from 2028.
OL,17,FBBC director-general Matt Brittin told
OL,18,Fthe Senedd's culture committee that the
OL,19,Fcorporation was in an "uncertain" time,
OL,20,Fhaving to make savings before it knew
OL,21,Fwhat the funding settlement was.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
